{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3289580/extras/CG20.png?t=1741593940\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It's your winter vacation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You were in your apartment hiding inside your heating table to keep yourself warm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Then, you received a phone call from your aunt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sensing a deja vu, you hurriedly press the button and receive the call.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u300cI won a lucky draw and got a ticket for a Hot Spring trip!\u300d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u300cSorry again for the short notice, but can you come over and look after Hazuki again?\u300d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The countryside I last visited in summer must have changed now that it's winter...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I wonder how she's been doing......</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your thoughts wander as you pull yourself out of the heating table and get yourself ready for a trip to the contryside.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u2606Character Introduction</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3289580/extras/\u540d\u79f0\u672a\u8a2d\u5b9a_2.png?t=1741593940\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Natsuhara Hazuki</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your cousin and childhood friend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It's been a while since you met her last summer. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">She may not look so approachable, but that's only because</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">she's still exploring your relationship with you and her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">She doesn't swim in winter, so her tanlines are gone, and her hair grew longer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">She's no longer reluctant in bodily contact, and couldn't forget the days with you back in summer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u2606H Scenes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can enjoy 3 kinds of H scenes throught out the game: HCG, H animation and pixel H animation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3289580/extras/\u30b9\u30af\u30ea\u30fc\u30f3\u30b7\u30e7\u30c3\u30c8_2024-10-17_120922.png?t=1741593940\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3289580/extras/dotHCG.gif?t=1741593940\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3289580/extras/WINTER-2024-10-23-14-50-35.gif?t=1741593940\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u2606Game System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3289580/extras/WINTER-2024-10-23-09-52-29.gif?t=1741593940\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u30fbBring Hazuki around and have sex freely anywhere</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u30fbFully voiced</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u30fbVarious costumes to change into, which will also be reflected in pixel H scenes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u30fbPurchase items to unlock more H scenes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u30fbAbundance of high-quality HCG</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u30fbSpecial pixel H animations unlocked through certain conditions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u30fbH Status window with all your sexual records\u00a0 with Hazuki</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Bestie","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3289580/9ede64f71e7af7222bc0aaaefffc5592832733cd.jpg"},{"name":"Hot Winter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3289580/a84ecadc3ad7